start cloudstack-management on both nodes\\n4. Stop / isolate the MySQL source (simulate site/DB failure)\\n5. Use UI/API through the remaining Management Server\\n\\n### What to do about it?\\n\\nExpected: MS fail over to replica promptly; UI remains usable.\\n\\nActual: UI becomes very slow after source outage (connector retries against unreachable source; defaults secondsBeforeRetrySource/queriesBeforeRetrySource/initialTimeout = 3600/5000/3600).\\n\\nSuggestions:\\n- fix connector failover so replica is used without per-request source retries hanging the UI\\n- and/or document clearly that db.ha.enabled is not recommended for production on MySQL 8.x and that manual promotion (install guide Failover) is the supported path\",\"author_association\":\"NONE\",\"user\":{\"login\":\"nabassa1323\",\"id\":132025448,\"node_id\":\"U_kgDOB96MaA\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132025448?v=4\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/nabassa1323\",\"gravatar_id\":\"\",\"type\":\"User\",\"site_admin\":false,\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/nabassa1323\",\"events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/nabassa1323/events{/privacy}\",\"following_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/nabassa1323/following{/other_user}\",\"followers_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/nabassa1323/followers\",\"gists_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/nabassa1323/gists{/gist_id}\",\"organizations_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/nabassa1323/orgs\",\"received_events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/nabassa1323/received_events\",\"repos_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/nabassa1323/repos\",\"starred_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/nabassa1323/starred{/owner}{/repo}\",\"subscriptions_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/nabassa1323/subscriptions\"},\"comments\":1,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-15T08:09:11Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-01T08:48:08Z\",\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/issues/14172\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/apache/cloudsta